@AspireJavaScript.MinimalApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5084

### The whole tracking board
GET {{AspireJavaScript.MinimalApi_HostAddress}}/api/shipments
Accept: application/json

### Shipments with an exception
GET {{AspireJavaScript.MinimalApi_HostAddress}}/api/shipments?status=exception
Accept: application/json

### Track a shipment
GET {{AspireJavaScript.MinimalApi_HostAddress}}/api/shipments/CTS-48214101
Accept: application/json

### 404 problem details (unknown tracking number)
GET {{AspireJavaScript.MinimalApi_HostAddress}}/api/shipments/CTS-00000000
Accept: application/problem+json

### 400 validation problem details (unknown status)
GET {{AspireJavaScript.MinimalApi_HostAddress}}/api/shipments?status=lost
Accept: application/problem+json

### Simulate tracking lookups (Development only)
POST {{AspireJavaScript.MinimalApi_HostAddress}}/dev/simulate-lookups

### OpenAPI document
GET {{AspireJavaScript.MinimalApi_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json